FTP
    Filezilla server is used

    create a user on filezilla server with user name as admin and password as admin

    In server listeners set as Explicit FTP over TLS and insecure plain FTP

    In configuration set the following paths
    
        Virtal path (To be given in client app url)
            
            example:    
            /Files
            ftpUrl = "ftp://admin:admin@localhost/Files/test.txt";

        Native path (Actual path of the files in FTP server)
    
            example:
            /home/bharadwaj/QBurst/c++/FTP_Server

    compilation:

        g++ test.cpp -o test -lcurl
